OL,3,GNEWSAPart of M5 remains closed after
OL,4,Aserious accident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M5 remained partially closed
OL,7,Fnorthbound in Worcestershire on
OL,8,FSaturday after a two-car crash left a
OL,9,Fdriver with "serious life-changing
OL,10,Finjuries", police said.
OL,12,FThe motorway was shut in both
OL,13,Fdirections at about 04:00 GMT between
OL,14,Fjunction five near Droitwich and
OL,15,Fjunction 4a for the M42, according to
OL,16,FNational Highways.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
