OL,3,GNEWSAPart of M5 remains closed after
OL,4,Aserious accident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe southbound carriageway reopened
OL,7,Fshortly after 06:00 GMT. About 12 hours
OL,8,Flater, lanes three and four on the
OL,9,Fnorthbound side were also reopened,
OL,10,Falthough lanes one and two remained
OL,11,Fclosed for recovery work. Delays
OL,12,Fcontinued into Saturday night.
OL,14,FWest Mercia Police appealed for
OL,15,Fwitnesses to the crash, which involved
OL,16,Fan Audi SQ5 and a Volkswagen Scirocco.
OL,17,FThe driver of the Audi, a man in his
OL,18,F50s, suffered serious injuries.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
